{"title":"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A right triangle has legs of lengths <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in. and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/7/6c77cf4b63af80bfbc6a9ad9b4b9e8e549e77d78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"24\" height=\"18\" /> in. What is the length of the hypotenuse?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/6/136a0ff0abbf04805aa355ad09f4cde5a15c0730.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\  5 \\text{ in.} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\  7 \\text{ in.} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\  49 \\text{ in.} \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\  \\sqrt{5} \\text{ in.} \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\  \\sqrt{7} \\text{ in.} \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"544\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For any <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Right_triangle\" title=\"Right triangle\">right triangle</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/1/e619905e1807355abee718ea72b98d69e386bed2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{2} + b^{2} = c^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"96\" height=\"18\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is the length of one leg of the triangle, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is the length of the other, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> is the length of the hypotenuse. This means:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/2/4b2fb7e8f6c0c098da1c240e8babb006967d1186.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c^{2} = 2^{2} + (\\sqrt{3})^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"126\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/a/71abf476800617d8365562b8c1b190981291d5f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c^{2} = 4 + 3 = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"115\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/b/e1bfa00bd13e5424d181ca6744a3223b3a6b58fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = \\boxed{\\textbf {(E) } \\sqrt{7} \\text{ in.}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"127\" height=\"35\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest\">2025 TMTA Algebra I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Answer_Key\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"